{"product_id":"tegami-bachi-vol-15","title":"Tegami Bachi, Vol. 15","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Amberground is locked in darkness. A man-made star casts only a dim light over the land. The pitch-black wilderness is infested with Gaichuu--colossal insects with metal exoskeletons. The Gaichuu make travel between the cities of Amberground extremely dangerous. But thankfully the Letter Bees, a brave corps of messengers, risk their lives in order to keep the hearts of Amberground connected\"--Page [4] of cover, v. 1. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 190  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Hiroyuki Asada \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781421556161 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43402579017881,"sku":"5RC9781421556161","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/3348ddbe810c9d0299f256ebc137de6e.jpg?v=1695366149","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tegami-bachi-vol-15","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}